&lt;p&gt;The 10-lead ECG patient cable assembly with RJ45 connector is designed for precise and efficient heart monitoring. Featuring snap-end connectors and available in either IEC or AHA color coding, this cable supports real-time heart readings on compact, handheld devices, making it suitable for both clinical and home environments.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
